```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "lay every bags holding back into its doc, diff-gated"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///carriage.holding.lays", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/carriage.holding.lays"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/carriage.holding.lays"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! carriage.holding.lays ~ each bags/* holding, laid back into its doc by kind

`lares vessel lay` walks every holding under the canon source and lays it into its doc, kind-routed and diff-gated, by the act CREATE and the ingest it runs (so it passes `--change-id`, `--dry-run`, `--in-wiki`, `--shadow` and `--tag-blobs` through to them). Bare it previews; `--apply` lands, asking at a terminal, `--yes` with none (an apply with neither refuses `usage`). `--lag` reads how far canon lags the source and the floor's drift, writing nothing; `--workbench` walks the workbench folders alone; `--lift-kahua <N>` lifts kahua items; `--verbose` prints each line.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ preview · apply · lag

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`preview` params=`~ preview the lay`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`apply` params=`apply/true ~ land it`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`lag` params=`lag/true ~ read the lag`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ apply · lag · workbench · lift-kahua · verbose · change-id · dry-run · in-wiki · shadow · tag-blobs

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`apply` params=`~ land the lay; preview bare`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`lag` params=`~ read canon's lag and the floor drift, writing nothing`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`workbench` params=`~ walk the checkout's workbench folders alone`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`lift-kahua` params=`takes/index ~ lift kahua items for this face`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`verbose` params=`~ print every line`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`change-id` params=`takes/id ~ passed to the act and ingest beneath`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`dry-run` params=`~ passed to the act and ingest beneath`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`in-wiki` params=`~ passed to the act beneath`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`shadow` params=`~ passed to the act and ingest beneath`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`tag-blobs` params=`~ passed to the ingest beneath`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ write

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`write` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the act CREATE and ingest gates beneath check the face's caps`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · house-canon-unseated

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[carriage.holding.lays apply/true]] ~ an apply with no terminal needs the operator's relayed approval: --yes`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`house-canon-unseated` params=`~ the holding landed after the vessel booted; re-stand to seat it`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ laid · lag

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`laid` params=`exit/0 ~ each holding laid, skipped or floored, named`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`lag` params=`exit/0 fields/[[holdings benches lag floorDrift]] ~ canon's lag and the floor drift`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares vessel lay

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares vessel lay]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

